<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="et">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<title>Rasmus Tiiman - veebiprogrammeerimine</title>
</head>
<body>
	<img src="/media/veebiprogrammeerimine_2026_TA.png" alt="">
	<h1>Isikute ja filmide seosed</h1>
	<p>Siin lehel on näha, millistes Eesti filmides ja mis ametis on filmiinimesed osalenud.</p>
	<hr>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="/">Avalehele</a></li>
		<li><a href="/eestifilm">Eesti filmi avaleht</a></li>
	</ul>
	<hr>
	<ol>
		<% relationList.forEach(function(relation){%>
		<li><%= relation.first_name %> <%= relation.last_name %>, <%= relation.movie_title %> (<%= relation.release_year %>), <%= relation.profession_title %><% if(relation.character_name){ %> (<%= relation.character_name %>)<% } %></li>
		<% }); %>
	</ol>
</body>
</html>